    "created_at": "2018-04-24T14:48:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-24T14:48:11Z",
    "body": "I'm inclined to align firefox with chrome and safari here.  Its not truly a redirect and trying to magically treat it like one seems error prone.  Since Firefox is not providing a referer header it seems like doing this should have minimal compat risk.\r\n\r\nIts unclear to me, though, if edge could follow without breaking some legacy sites depending on their current referer behavior.",
